378
00:18:52.800 --> 00:18:54.501
<font color=#0080C0><font color=#808080>[with raspy voice]</font> Dirty ones.</font>

379
00:18:54.534 --> 00:18:56.938
<font color=#0080C0>Oh, like Danielle Steel?
My mom loves her.</font>

380
00:18:56.971 --> 00:18:58.505
<font color=#0080C0>Yeah, well, I went to college</font>

