the one that actually does...</font>

1291
01:12:48.269 --> 01:12:49.170
<font color=#808080>[Max scoffs]</font>

1292
01:12:49.737 --> 01:12:51.739
<font color=#0080C0>Look, I know that this sucks,</font>

1293
01:12:51.772 --> 01:12:53.607
<font color=#0080C0>but you being angry about it?</font>

1294
01:12:53.641 --> 01:12:55.843
<font color=#0080C0>That's just going to cost you
a chance to say goodbye.</font>

1295
01:13:00.181 --> 01:13:02.549
<font color=#808080>[light dramatic music]</font>

1296
01:13:07.688 --> 01:13:09.857
<font color=#808080>[machine beeping]</font>

1297
01:13:10.791 --> 01:13:12.760
<font color=#808080>[Alex breathing deeply]</font>

1298
01:13:20.735 --> 01:13:22.036
<font color=#808080>[Alex's struggled breathing]</font>

1299
01:13:28.943 --> 01:13:34.148
<font color=#0080C0><font color=#808080>[Max with echoed voice]</font> Hey, I,
I just figured, decorate the walls,</font>

1300
01:13:34.181 --> 01:13:35.649
<font color=#0080C0>it felt so empty.</font>

1301
01:13:47.795 --> 01:13:50.631
<font color=#0080C0>I finally stitched you
like one of my French girls.</font>

1302
01:13:53.167 --> 01:13:54.268
<font color=#808080>[Alex chuckles]</font>

1303
01:13:59.774 --> 01:14:02.043
<font color=#0080C0>I'm really sorry I haven't
been here so much.</font>

1304
01:14:04.779 --> 01:14:06.881
<font color=#0080C0>I know this,
this isn't about me.</font>

1305
01:14:08.082 --> 01:14:09.050
<font color=#0080C0>I'm just.</font>

1306
01:14:13.721 --> 01:14:15.823
<font color=#808080>[gentle ambient music]</font>

1307
01:14:24.165 --> 01:14:27.034
<font color=#0080C0>I'm just finding it
really hard to say goodbye.</font>

1308
01:14:29.336 --> 01:14:30.671
<font color=#0080C0>Hey.</font>

1309
01:14:31.806 --> 01:14:35.009
<font color=#0080C0>Don't be jealous that
I'm better at dying than you.</font>

1310
01:14:35.743 --> 01:14:36.710
<font color=#808080>[Max laughs]</font>

1311
01:14:43.851 --> 01:14:44.852
<font color=#0080C0>Look.</font>

1312
01:14:48.222 --> 01:14:49.123
<font color=#0080C0>See?</font>

1313
01:14:51.092 --> 01:14:54.228
<font color=#0080C0><font color=#808080>[sobbing]</font> Who else is going to do
offensive shit like that with me?</font>

1314
01:14:54.261 --> 01:14:55.830
<font color=#808080>[Alex chuckles]</font>

1315
01:14:55.863 --> 01:14:57.631
<font color=#808080>[Alex gasps]</font>

1316
01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:01.035
<font color=#808080>[Alex groans]</font>

1317
01:15:04.939 --> 01:15:06.006
<font color=#808080>[Alex groans]</font>

1318
01:15:12.213 --> 01:15:14.748
<font color=#0080C0>I just want it to be over.</font>

1319
01:15:23.757 --> 01:15:25.126
<font color=#0080C0>Close your eyes.</font>

1320
01:15:27.828 --> 01:15:29.964
<font color=#808080>[gentle ambient music]</font>

1321
01:16:24.385 --> 01:16:25.286
<font color=#0080C0>Okay.</font>

1322
01:16:38.332 --> 01:16:39.800
<font color=#0080C0>Max.</font>

1323
01:16:41.835 --> 01:16:43.304
<font color=#0080C0>I'm scared.</font>

1324
01:16:46.473 --> 01:16:47.775
<font color=#0080C0>You don't have to.</font>

1325
01:16:48.242 --> 01:16:51.078
<font color=#808080>[dramatic music]</font>

1326
01:17:07.861 --> 01:17:09.763
<font color=#808080>[gentle music]</font>

1327
01:17:14.868 --> 01:17:17.271
<font color=#808080>[machine beeping]</font>

1328
01:17:32.886 --> 01:17:34.355
<font color=#0080C0>Are you not feeling anything?</font>

1329
01:17:37.258 --> 01:17:38.158
<font color=#0080C0>I don't know.</font>

1330
01:17:39.994 --> 01:17:41.195
<font color=#0080C0>It's not working?</font>

1331
01:17:42.563 --> 01:17:44.131
<font color=#0080C0>Your face...</font>

1332
01:17:46.066 --> 01:17:47.368
<font color=#0080C0>it's just...</font>

1333
01:17:55.876 --> 01:17:56.977
<font color=#0080C0>it's you.</font>

1334
01:18:02.617 --> 01:18:04.118
<font color=#808080>[Max chuckles]</font>

1335
01:18:18.132 --> 01:18:19.967
<font color=#808080>- [machine blaring]
- [Alex groans]</font>

1336
01:18:20.000 --> 01:18:21.101
<font color=#808080>[Alex gasps]</font>

1337
01:18:21.135 --> 01:18:23.203
<font color=#808080>[heart pounding]</font>

1338
01:18:25.406 --> 01:18:30.477
<font color=#0080C0><font color=#808080>[Max]</font> Help, help! I need help!</font>

1339
01:18:32.079 --> 01:18:34.014
<font color=#0080C0><font color=#808080>[nurse with echoed voice]</font>
Alex, listen to me.</font>

1340
01:18:34.481 --> 01:18:36.550
<font color=#808080>[voiced drowned out
by machine beeping]</font>

1341
01:18:37.885 --> 01:18:39.453
<font color=#808080>[machine beeping]</font>

1342
01:18:56.136 --> 01:18:57.538
<font color=#808080>[gentle ambient music]</font>

1343
01:19:20.662 --> 01:19:22.930
<font color=#0080C0><font color=#808080>[Alex]</font> <i>Have you ever thought
about if your life were</i></font>

1344
01:19:22.963 --> 01:19:25.165
<font color=#0080C0><i>a movie, what song they would
use in the montage?</i></font>

1345
01:19:27.034 --> 01:19:28.936
<font color=#0080C0><i>This is for one of those moments</i></font>

1346
01:19:28.969 --> 01:19:30.571
<font color=#0080C0><i>where your life derails you.</i></font>

1347
01:19:33.440 --> 01:19:36.176
<font color=#0080C0><i>And your head
and your heart can't keep up.</i></font>

1348
01:19:45.953 --> 01:19:47.622
<font color=#0080C0><i>Everything plays out
like a blur,</i></font>

1349
01:19:49.490 --> 01:19:51.291
<font color=#0080C0><i>and all you hear...</i></font>

1350
01:19:54.995 --> 01:19:55.630
<font color=#0080C0><i>is this.</i></font>

1351
01:19:56.497 --> 01:19:59.667
<font color=#808080>["Turn Out The Lights"
by Julien Baker]</font>

1352
01:20:13.313 --> 01:20:16.718
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ There's a hole
in the drywall ♪</i></font>

1353
01:20:16.751 --> 01:20:19.486
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ Still not fixed ♪</i></font>

1354
01:20:19.520 --> 01:20:24.659
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ I just haven't
gotten around to it ♪</i></font>

1355
01:20:24.692 --> 01:20:29.596
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ And besides
I'm starting to get used ♪</i></font>

1356
01:20:29.631 --> 01:20:32.599
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ To the gaps ♪</i></font>

1357
01:20:49.684 --> 01:20:55.723
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ Say you wish you could
find some way to help ♪</i></font>

1358
01:20:55.757 --> 01:21:00.194
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ To be so hard on myself ♪</i></font>

1359
01:21:00.227 --> 01:21:05.999
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ So, why is it easy
for everyone else ♪</i></font>

1360
01:21:06.033 --> 01:21:09.002
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ I'm not always like this ♪</i></font>

1361
01:21:09.036 --> 01:21:13.140
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ There's always
tomorrow, I guess ♪</i></font>

1362
01:21:23.517 --> 01:21:29.389
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ And I'd never do it
but it's not a joke ♪</i></font>

1363
01:21:29.423 --> 01:21:35.128
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ I can't tell the difference
when I'm all alone ♪</i></font>

1364
01:21:35.162 --> 01:21:38.532
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ Is it real or a dream
which is worse ♪</i></font>

1365
01:21:38.565 --> 01:21:41.134
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ Can you help me ♪</i></font>

1366
01:21:41.168 --> 01:21:46.106
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ I just wanted to go to sleep ♪</i></font>

1367
01:21:56.550 --> 01:22:02.356
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ When I turn out the lights ♪</i></font>

1368
01:22:04.859 --> 01:22:10.497
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ There's no one left ♪</i></font>

1369
01:22:10.531 --> 01:22:15.770
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ Between myself ♪</i></font>

1370
01:22:17.471 --> 01:22:21.275
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ And me ♪</i></font>

1371
01:22:50.170 --> 01:22:56.276
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ But when I turn out
the lights ♪</i></font>

1372
01:22:56.310 --> 01:23:01.749
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ When I turn out the lights ♪</i></font>

1373
01:23:01.783 --> 01:23:08.255
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ When I turn out the lights ♪</i></font>

1374
01:23:08.288 --> 01:23:11.224
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ Oh, oh ♪</i></font>

1375
01:23:14.696 --> 01:23:21.401
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ There is no one ♪</i></font>

1376
01:23:21.435 --> 01:23:24.538
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ Left ♪</i></font>

1377
01:23:26.373 --> 01:23:30.410
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ Between ♪</i></font>

1378
01:23:30.444 --> 01:23:36.450
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ Myself ♪</i></font>

1379
01:23:37.852 --> 01:23:40.454
<font color=#8080FF><i>♪ And me ♪</i></font>

1380
01:24:01.876 --> 01:24:04.779
<font color=#0080C0>How are you feeling today
on a scale of one to ten?</font>

1381
01:24:05.312 --> 01:24:06.413
<font color=#0080C0>Um...</font>

1382
01:24:07.547 --> 01:24:11.318
<font color=#0080C0>I think, uh... like, a five.</font>

1383
01:24:11.986 --> 01:24:13.420
<font color=#0080C0>That's a wonderful improvement.</font>

1384
01:24:13.955 --> 01:24:15.255
<font color=#0080C0>Tell me, what's changed?</font>

1385
01:24:15.723 --> 01:24:18.826
<font color=#0080C0>Uh, you, you mean, since Alex?</font>

1386
01:24:19.393 --> 01:24:21.896
<font color=#0080C0>Well, yes, but more so with you.</font>

1387
01:24:21.929 --> 01:24:24.832
<font color=#808080>[upbeat music]</font>

1388
01:24:24.866 --> 01:24:27.501
<font color=#0080C0><font color=#808080>[Max]</font> <i>Valencia's case
finally settled.</i></font>

1389
01:24:27.534 --> 01:24:31.304
<font color=#0080C0><i>The coroner said she died
of a serotonin overdose,</i></font>

1390
01:24:31.338 --> 01:24:34.709
<font color=#0080C0><i>or as the jury saw it,
natural causes.</i></font>

1391
01:24:36.678 --> 01:24:39.847
<font color=#0080C0><i>So, the judge dropped
all of the charges,</i></font>

1392
01:24:40.982 --> 01:24:41.949
<font color=#0080C0><i>even for Craig.</i></font>

1393
01:24:43.483 --> 01:24:45.585
<font color=#0080C0><i>After the trial, the publicity</i></font>

1394
01:24:45.620 --> 01:24:48.690
<font color=#0080C0><i>from the case made
national headlines.</i></font>

1395
01:24:48.723 --> 01:24:50.992
<font color=#0080C0><i>Most people didn't believe
there could be a kid</i></font>

1396
01:24:51.025 --> 01:24:55.562
<font color=#0080C0><i>with a lethally attractive face.</i></font>

1397
01:24:55.595 --> 01:24:59.232
<font color=#0080C0><i>But there are others
who somehow knew,</i></font>

1398
01:24:59.266 --> 01:25:02.302
<font color=#0080C0><i>or hoped that I could help them,</i></font>

1399
01:25:03.437 --> 01:25:04.872
<font color=#0080C0><i>the same way Alex hoped</i></font>

1400
01:25:04.906 --> 01:25:05.973
<font color=#0080C0><i>that I could help her.</i></font>

1401
01:25:08.475 --> 01:25:12.412
<font color=#0080C0><i>I always thought that
my face only caused pain,</i></font>

1402
01:25:12.446 --> 01:25:15.817
<font color=#0080C0><i>what I learned was, I could
use it to take pain away.</i></font>

1403
01:25:17.451 --> 01:25:19.386
<font color=#0080C0><i>I still visit Esther.</i></font>

1404
01:25:19.419 --> 01:25:21.521
<font color=#0080C0><i>She sometimes
asks where Alex is.</i></font>

1405
01:25:21.555 --> 01:25:24.726
<font color=#0080C0><i>It's harder for her
to remember the big things.</i></font>

1406
01:25:24.759 --> 01:25:27.628
<font color=#0080C0><i>I tell her that Alex
is busy suing Danielle Steel</i></font>

1407
01:25:27.662 --> 01:25:33.668
<font color=#0080C0><i>for plagiarism,
that always makes her happy.</i></font>

1408
01:25:33.701 --> 01:25:39.774
<font color=#0080C0><i>The last thing Alex taught me
was that those that see me for me</i></font>

1409
01:25:39.807 --> 01:25:43.611
<font color=#0080C0><i>don't find my face
to be the most attractive part.</i></font>

1410
01:25:43.644 --> 01:25:45.545
<font color=#0080C0><i>Unconditional love
is the immunity.</i></font>

1411
01:25:47.447 --> 01:25:49.617
<font color=#0080C0><i>And while I'll never
live a life completely</i></font>

1412
01:25:49.650 --> 01:25:52.486
<font color=#0080C0><i>without wrappings,
I can find moments</i></font>

1413
01:25:52.519 --> 01:25:55.823
<font color=#0080C0><i>with the ones that matter.</i></font>

1414
01:25:55.857 --> 01:26:00.327
<font color=#0080C0><i>Even my parents
have gotten... closer.</i></font>

1415
01:26:00.360 --> 01:26:04.331
<font color=#0080C0><i>They found a way to meet
each other in the middle.</i></font>

1416
01:26:13.808 --> 01:26:16.677
<font color=#0080C0>So, what's next?</font>

1417
01:26:17.645 --> 01:26:18.746
<font color=#0080C0>I'm not sure.</font>

1418
01:26:22.516 --> 01:26:24.451
<font color=#0080C0>Maybe trying
to live without these.</font>

1419
01:26:25.519 --> 01:26:26.586
<font color=#0080C0><font color=#808080>[therapist]</font> It's a big step.</font>

1420
01:26:28.355 --> 01:26:29.857
<font color=#0080C0>Do you think that's
something you can do?</font>

1421
01:26:33.761 --> 01:26:34.729
<font color=#0080C0>Yeah, I can try.</font>

1422
01:26:36.063 --> 01:26:38.699
<font color=#808080>[upbeat music]</font>

1423
01:27:45.032 --> 01:27:46.701
<font color=#0080C0>- <font color=#808080>[Max]</font> <i>Come on.</i>
- <font color=#808080>[Dan]</font> <i>I'm trying, I'm trying.</i></font>

1424
01:27:46.734 --> 01:27:48.169
<font color=#0080C0><font color=#808080>[Max]</font> Oh, God.</font>

1425
01:27:48.202 --> 01:27:49.502
<font color=#0080C0>- <font color=#808080>[Dan]</font> Oh, don't.
- <font color=#808080>[doorbell ringing]</font></font>

1426
01:27:49.536 --> 01:27:51.471
<font color=#0080C0><font color=#808080>[Max groans]</font> I'll get it.</font>

1427
01:27:52.840 --> 01:27:54.374
<font color=#0080C0>- <font color=#808080>[Dan]</font> Oh.
- <font color=#808080>[Max]</font> Pause it.</font>

1428
01:28:02.216 --> 01:28:04.584
<font color=#0080C0>Hey, so, my parents
thought it'd be a good idea</font>

1429
01:28:04.619 --> 01:28:06.654
<font color=#0080C0>if I apologize
or whatever it is, so...</font>

1430
01:28:07.520 --> 01:28:09.156
<font color=#0080C0>- Oh, shit.
- <font color=#808080>[Max]</font> Oh.</font>

1431
01:28:09.891 --> 01:28:12.760
<font color=#0080C0>Shit, shit!</font>

1432
01:28:14.527 --> 01:28:16.764
<font color=#0080C0>- Oh, my God.
- <font color=#808080>[Max]</font> I'm, I'm sorry.</font>

1433
01:28:17.832 --> 01:28:19.133
<font color=#0080C0>Damn it, Max.</font>

1434
01:28:19.166 --> 01:28:20.567
<font color=#808080>[Max sighs]</font>

1435
01:28:20.601 --> 01:28:23.170
<font color=#808080>[jovial music]</font>

1436
01:28:23.370 --> 01:28:30.370
<u><font color=#FF80FF>Subtitle By: <font color=#FF8040><b>MARSH-MARIE</b></font></font></u>

1437
01:29:44.852 --> 01:29:47.188
<font color=#808080>[gentle ambient music]</font>

1438
01:30:39.673 --> 01:30:42.176
<font color=#808080>[somber music]</font>
